{
  "app_id": 3613050,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "GRAVEBOUND is a 6-player co-op PvE extraction shooter set in a post-apocalyptic wasteland where humanity is gone and the appliances have taken over. Squad up, battle hordes of murderous machines and massive bosses, hunt for powerful loot, level up your build, and extract before the wasteland takes it all back. Every run is a chance to get stronger, push further, and discover new ways to absolutely dismantle the appliance apocalypse. Face off against massive appliance bosses , each with their own mechanics, attacks, and ways to ruin your run. Take on a psychotic Blender, survive the TV’s deadly broadcast, battle the Jukebox, crack the Freezer, and discover even more mechanical nightmares waiting across the wasteland. GRAVEBOUND is a 6-player co-op PvE extraction shooter set in a wasteland overrun by murderous machines. Fight together. Get stronger. Extract alive. Every run is a chance to come back stronger. Explore the wasteland, complete events, grab what you can and extract before things go very wrong. Find weapon stations throughout the wasteland and upgrade your armor/weapons mid-run. More damage. Bigger mags. Better stats. More ways to kill appliances. Your character keeps getting stronger outside the wasteland too. Unlock skills, make meaningful choices and build around the way you want to play."
  },
  "detailed_descriptions_html": {
